<section class="cc-opening">
  <div class="cc-opening-inner">
    <div class="cc-opening-text">
      <div class="cc-eyebrow">A deepening trajectory</div>
      <h2 class="cc-h2 cc-opening-h2">
        More than a training. <em>A path.</em>
      </h2>

      <p class="cc-opening-body">
        The certification course is a series of live classes, weekly Q&amp;As,
        hosted practice sessions, monthly two-hour CEEE deepening sessions
        with Jacob and advanced alumni, a global community of fellow
        travellers, and an optional retreat in Portugal.
      </p>
      <p class="cc-opening-body">
        You don't have to want to work professionally with this to belong
        here. Many participants are here to go further into their own
        healing — to learn how to travel through the layers of a sound, how
        to meet ancestors, how to hold space for the parts of themselves
        no one ever held space for.
      </p>
      <p class="cc-opening-pull">
        The certificate is real. So is the path of becoming a practitioner.
        But the heart of this course is the journey itself.
      </p>

      <a href="#register" class="cc-link-cta">
        Find your place on the path <i class="ph-light ph-arrow-down"></i>
      </a>
    </div>

